{
  "title": "消息组件",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n<h1>消息的组件</h1>\n<p class=\"Content_body\">消息显示在讨论面板区域内后，其中包含多个具有特定属性的组件。</p>\n<p class=\"Content_body\">消息的组件如下图所示：</p>\n<p class=\"Content_body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/image698.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: none;\" border=\"0\"></p>\n\n<!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_title\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n\n<!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n<p class=\"Content_body\">下表提供了消息的各个组件：</p>\n\n<table class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 64px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"1051\">\n<colgroup><col style=\"width: 22.021%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 77.979%;\">\n</colgroup><tbody><tr class=\"t1st\" style=\"height: 59px;\">\n<td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n<p class=\"Table_header\">消息组件</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n<p class=\"Table_header\" style=\"text-align: center;\">属性</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 47px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">来源图标</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">指示消息来源是用户评论还是自动生成。</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 45px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">用户名</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">创建评论的用户名称，可以是直接创建，也可以是通过历史记录间接创建。</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">创建时间</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">消息创建的时间</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">看板块目</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">看板块目显示消息所关联的条目的看板名称。<span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">看板块目还作为超链接，用于打开所引用条目的弹出窗口。</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 87px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">条目信息</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">条目信息显示消息创建时条目的基本信息。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>显示的字符串由安全消息的三个属性组合而成，如下所示：</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"Bulleted_list\">条目的当前版本号</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"Bulleted_list\">条目的当前代次</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"Bulleted_list\">条目的当前生命周期状态</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">条目图标</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">与看板块目对应的图标和颜色</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">消息文本</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">消息的文本内容。</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 45px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">缩略图</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">图片的缩略图（如果评论中包含图片）</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 262px;\">\n<td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">消息功能</p>\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; vertical-align: top;\">\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">可以对消息执行的功能。</p>\n<p class=\"Table_Body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/image74.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: none;\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p class=\"Table_Body\">可以对消息执行的功能，包括：</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: disc;\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"Bulleted_list\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">标记/取消标记</span> - 用户可以标记/取消标记消息。同时显示已标记/取消标记该消息的用户数量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">回复</span> - <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">允许用户输入评论来回复此消息</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; text-indent: 0px; font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; font-weight: bold;\">隐藏回复</span> <span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">- 允许用户隐藏回复消息的显示。</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"Bulleted_list\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">擦除</span> - <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">允许用户擦除先前创建的</span>消息</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<h2>消息的显示</h2>\n<p class=\"Content_body\">显示的消息数量由安全消息 ItemType（物料类型）的默认页面大小属性控制。</p>\n<p class=\"Content_body\">使用滚动键向上滚动和向下滚动到底部来浏览显示的消息。点击讨论面板页脚处的 \"<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">显示更多消息</span>\" 可以显示更多消息。</p>\n<p class=\"Content_body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/image699.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: none;\" border=\"0\"></p>\n\n<!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_title\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n\n<!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n<p class=\"Content_body\">当所有消息都已显示时，讨论面板的页脚会显示 \"<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">没有更多消息</span>\"。</p>\n\n<p class=\"Content_body\"><img src=\"/aras-images/image700.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"border: none;\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_title\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n\n<!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Message_Components.htm"
}